	(text "Bus: 48 V operating on 80 V FETs. D1001 (SMDJ54A, 54 V\nstandoff) clamps it; C1001 and C1002 are the bulk.\nVBUS_SENSE = VBUS x 4k7 / 116k7 (0.1 %), on ADC2.\n\n12 V gate rail: LMR38010, starting at 9.9 V on the\nR1003/R1004 divider. GATE_OFF (GPIO14) high turns Q1001 on\nand stops the rail, taking the gate drivers' supply away.\nR1005 holds it low through reset, so the rail comes up and\nthe drivers brake the motor.\n\n5 V logic rail: LMR38010, diode-ORed with USB (D1002, sheet\n05) through D1003. The 3V3 LDO on sheet 02 runs from +5V." (exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5000 29.2100 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "f14857e8-37ba-5c47-a7f2-355f40990e6f"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
